      "id": "hackernews-2026-08-10-confessions-of-a-long-distance-sailor",
      "title": "Confessions of a Long-Distance Sailor",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://arachnoid.com/lutusp/sailbook.html\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49249555\nPoints: 131\n# Comments: 39",
      "body": "In 1988, I sailed away from the West coast of the United States in a 31-foot\nsailboat. This is my story\n— my account of a 3 1/2-year around the world solo sail.\nRead about the pirates, storms, and wars I witnessed firsthand.\nRead about the relationship between a solo sailor and the sea, his daily\nRead how I changed — from fearing to leave shore, to wanting never to touch\nIf you have ever wondered what it feels like to sail free, alone on the sea,\nlet me take you on my voyage, my adventure — read my book, sail with me!\n\"Confessions of a Long-Distance Sailor\"\nDownload this book in ZIP form for offline reading:\nconfessions.zip (1.3 MB): zipped HTML pages and graphics\nMy book \"Confessions of a Long-Distance Sailor\" is in the CareWare\nprogram. No money, now or ever — but not exactly",
