      "author": "Antonio G. Di Benedetto",
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/268691_Chuwi_UniBook_laptop_review_ADiBenedetto_0015.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,10.732984293194,100,78.534031413613",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/977031/chuwi-unibook-laptop-intel-wildcat-lake-review",
